; ---------------------------------------------------------------- tread motion
; Each tread overlay shows a region of the SAME machine texture and draws only
; the pixels its mask marks (masks are derived from the base PNG). Geometry is
; in texture px, re-derived from the current machine PNG: the belt centrelines,
; the diagonal/arc/vertical bend and the 50.0 / 50.75 px chevron pitch were all
; measured on level1_machine_base.png. Speed is set from the machine scale in
; level_1_v3.gd (78 world px/s).
