; The Junction plate: its own round-belt shader. plate_angle tilts the slats to
; face the selected exit and sends the surface that way; level_1_v3.gd swings it
; between the two arm directions on every route change. Sampling cross-fades
; between two points one slat pitch apart instead of hard-wrapping at the rim,
; so the whole disc animates as one piece with no seam and no static ring.
[sub_resource type="ShaderMaterial" id="ShaderMaterial_junction_disc"]
