; opened up: at this height the arms' inner edges sit near x 235 and x 485, so
; the centred text clears both rails by well over 50 px and still sits above the
; bin rims (y 892). Farther from the chamber than the apex, but unobstructed;
; TapHintLeader above bridges that gap back to the Junction.
